      "user": "Adam Owsianka",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/21639275-1772399671.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "War has changed. It's no longer about nations, ideologies, or ethnicity. It's an endless series of proxy battles fought by mercenaries and machines. War - and its consumption of life - has become a well-oiled machine. Genetic control. Information control. Emotion control. Battlefield control. Everything is monitored and kept under control. War has changed. The age of deterrence has become the age of control... All in the name of averting catastrophe from weapons of mass destruction. And he who controls the battlefield. .. controls history. War has changed. When the battlefield is under total control... War becomes routine."
    },
    {
      "game": "Call of Duty: Ghosts Digital Hardened Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/9529/450x258/call-of-duty-ghosts-digital-hardened-edition-digital-hardened-edition-xbox-one-xbox-series-x-s-game-microsoft-store-europe-cover.jpg?v=1788544800",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/9529-buy-call-of-duty-ghosts-digital-hardened-edition-digital-hardened-edition-xbox-one-xbox-series-x-s-game-microsoft-store-europe/",
      "user": "obliu",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/12150143-1617316605.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Ghost was and still underrated! Very unique \n\n\n\ni love ghost in every mode but extinction and mp is still resonate in me, since 2013 when i tried early before release at the stand of Activion, Great Memories. \n\n\n\nMy Disc of ghost was broken after all these years so i decide to bought the hardned edition to have all the maps, thanks instant gaming to provide games more accessible to everyone !!! \n\n\n\nit' was very surprising to see the majority of the players i encountered are fans and have the pics of ghost makes me happy that im not alone to love this game to this day!"
    },
    {
